# majkee.deny — per-leg deny registry for the ~/.majkee sync leg
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Same contract as sync.deny: one glob per line, blank lines and # comments
# ignored. Applied as rsync --exclude on the ~/.majkee → ia-sync/majkee/ leg.
# Registry-shaped by design (operator, 2026-07-30): exclusions are data, not
# code — the pattern generalizes per leg (sync.deny = zsh, majkee.deny = this,
# codex.deny = pending WS5).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Process data — tcr + repomix outputs. Machine-local, never in the repo.
# config/ (the tcr/repomix *configs*) DOES sync; only their outputs stay home.
export/

# Delicate small notes (SHM harness) — machine-local, never in the repo.
# Parked 2026-07-30 (pad.4 companion note), wired 2026-07-31; spelling fixed same day.
cooking-recipes/
